    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Imperialis Fleet",
    "summary": "As your Command phase begins, choose one policy until your next Command phase starts. Eliminate At All Costs marks a single enemy on the board. Your Agents of the Imperium models get +1 to hit it. For Acquire At All Costs, designate one of the board’s objective markers. Your Agents of the Imperium models gain a 5+ invulnerable save and improve Leadership and Objective Control by 1 while their unit is in range of that marker.",
